    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0279" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1875v01/pg189"/>

                <p>Therefore the present treaty having been approved by decree of this date, I have
                    ratified it, holding it as a national law, and pledging for its observance the
                    national honor.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">In faith whereof I sign the present
                        ratification, sealed with the seal of the republic and countersigned by the
                        secretary of state for foreign affairs, at <placeName>Lima</placeName>, on
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-01-12">the twelfth day of January,
                            in the year of our Lord one thousand eight hundred and
                        sixty-six</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MARIANO IGNACIO PRADO.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>TORIBIO PACHECO.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
